  "entries": {
    "generatedtip_item_2503_description": "<section></section><section><attention>%i:scaleAP%@FlatMagicDamageMod@</attention>法术强度<br><attention>%i:scaleMana% @FlatMPPoolMod@</attention>法力<br><attention>%i:scaleCooldown%@AbilityHasteMod@</attention>技能急速</section><section><passive>邪焰</passive><br>伤害型技能造成每秒<magicDamage>@BurnDamagePerSecondCalc@额外魔法伤害</magicDamage>，持续@BurnDuration@秒。<br><br><passive>黯炎</passive><br>被你的<passive>邪焰</passive>影响的每个敌方英雄、史诗级野怪和大型野怪都会为你提供<scaleAP>@APPerStack*100@%法术强度</scaleAP>。 </section><section></section><section><flavorText>'黑雾需要一团程度与之相配的火焰。'</flavorText></section>",
    "generatedtip_item_3100_description": "<section></section><section><attention>%i:scaleAP%@FlatMagicDamageMod@</attention>法术强度<br><attention>%i:scaleMS%@PercentMovementSpeedMod*100@%</attention>移动速度<br><attention>%i:scaleCooldown%@AbilityHasteMod@</attention>技能急速</section><section><passive>咒刃</passive>{{ Item_Cooldown}}<br>施放技能后，你在@SpellBladeDuration@秒内的下一次攻击会获得<attackSpeed>@SheenASBuff*100@%攻击速度</attackSpeed>并造成<magicDamage>@SpellbladeDamage@额外魔法伤害</magicDamage>{{ Item_Keyword_OnHit }}。</section><section></section><section><flavorText></flavorText></section>",
    "item_cooldown": "%i:cooldown% (@Cooldown@秒)",
    "item_keyword_onhit": "%i:OnHit%<OnHit>攻击特效</OnHit>",
    "generatedtip_item_3115_description": "<section></section><section><attention>%i:scaleAP%@FlatMagicDamageMod@</attention>法术强度<br><attention>%i:scaleAS%@PercentAttackSpeedMod*100@%</attention>攻击速度<br><attention>%i:scaleCooldown%@AbilityHasteMod@</attention>技能急速</section><section><passive>艾卡西亚之咬</passive><br>普攻造成<magicDamage>@TotalOnHitDamage@额外魔法伤害</magicDamage> {{ Item_Keyword_OnHit }}。</section><section></section><section><flavorText></flavorText></section>"
